{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And they could not speak to him peaceably.</b> This is a good quality in them: that they would show the hatred in their hearts and not act hypocritically. Thus Solomon said (Proverbs 29:5): ״גבר מחליק על רעהו רשת פורש על פעמיו״. And so Scripture praises Avshalom, as it is said (II Samuel 13:22): ״ולא דבר אבשלום עם אמנון למרע ועד טוב כי שנא אבשלום את אמנון״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {0 "The citation reads (ש\"א י״ג), literally 'I Samuel 13,' but the quoted verse is II Samuel 13:22; normalized to II Samuel 13:22."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:18:06.467916726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}